WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:07.797 --> 00:00:08.865
Ukrainian officials are warning

00:00:08.999 --> 00:00:12.002
Russia is gearing up to what

00:00:12.135 --> 00:00:14.237
they're describing as maximum

00:00:14.371 --> 00:00:15.572
escalation just ahead of a

00:00:15.572 --> 00:00:17.574
possible spring military

00:00:17.707 --> 00:00:21.111
offensive against Ukraine.

00:00:21.244 --> 00:00:21.845
CNN's correspondent Fred

00:00:21.978 --> 00:00:24.581
pleitgen has our report from the

00:00:24.714 --> 00:00:25.115
frontlines.

00:00:25.115 --> 00:00:27.984
[ Gunfire ]

00:00:28.118 --> 00:00:29.920
&gt;&gt; Reporter: All-out warfare on

00:00:30.053 --> 00:00:31.588
the eastern front.

00:00:31.688 --> 00:00:33.590
We're in a trench with Ukrainian

00:00:33.590 --> 00:00:37.027
paratroopers.

00:00:37.160 --> 00:00:38.628
As they fire on Russian

00:00:38.762 --> 00:00:41.598
positions using aks and a U.S.

00:00:41.698 --> 00:00:43.633
Supplied browning heavy machine

00:00:43.767 --> 00:00:46.536
gun.
They're searching for weak spots

00:00:46.670 --> 00:00:48.605
in our position, says the

00:00:48.738 --> 00:00:49.673
commander, call sign ghost.

00:00:49.806 --> 00:00:52.642
They want to see if we fight

00:00:52.776 --> 00:00:53.243
back.

00:00:53.243 --> 00:00:54.978
If we show strong resistance,

00:00:55.111 --> 00:00:55.946
they don't advance.

00:00:56.079 --> 00:00:57.614
And this is what strong

00:00:57.714 --> 00:01:04.854
resistance looks like.

00:01:04.988 --> 00:01:08.191
The Lu Russians are only about 400

00:01:08.325 --> 00:01:09.626
yards away, hidden in the snow

00:01:09.626 --> 00:01:11.628
and fog, but constantly firing

00:01:11.628 --> 00:01:14.764
at the entrinched Ukrainian.

00:01:14.898 --> 00:01:17.634
The enemy uses small arms, heavy

00:01:17.634 --> 00:01:20.370
machine guns, artillery,

00:01:20.503 --> 00:01:21.304
mortars, rocket launchers and

00:01:21.638 --> 00:01:25.041
aviation, as well.

00:01:25.175 --> 00:01:27.043
But so far, the Ukrainians say

00:01:27.177 --> 00:01:27.744
they haven't lost an inch of

00:01:27.877 --> 00:01:29.946
territory here.

00:01:30.080 --> 00:01:31.648
The Ukrainians say the situation

00:01:31.681 --> 00:01:33.817
here is reminiscent of some of

00:01:33.950 --> 00:01:35.652
the worst times in World War II

00:01:35.652 --> 00:01:36.953
where they are not only fighting

00:01:37.120 --> 00:01:38.888
a strong adversary but the

00:01:39.022 --> 00:01:39.656
elements, as well.

00:01:39.656 --> 00:01:42.025
The snow, the mud, and the cold

00:01:42.158 --> 00:01:45.762
make fighting here even tougher.

00:01:45.895 --> 00:01:47.197
And Ukraine's leadership

00:01:47.330 --> 00:01:49.199
believes the Russians will soon

00:01:49.332 --> 00:01:50.700
escalate even more after

00:01:50.834 --> 00:01:51.768
mobilizing hundreds of thousands

00:01:51.901 --> 00:01:52.602
of men for a likely spring

00:01:52.736 --> 00:01:55.939
offensive.

00:01:56.072 --> 00:01:57.941
But this gunner, who goes by the

00:01:58.074 --> 00:01:59.709
name deputy, says the

00:01:59.843 --> 00:02:00.977
paratroopers are ready.

00:02:01.111 --> 00:02:02.746
"It will be hard, it will be

00:02:02.879 --> 00:02:04.848
tough, but we will hold because

00:02:04.981 --> 00:02:06.116
we stand here for our land.

00:02:06.249 --> 00:02:10.086
If we don't do it, nobody will."

00:02:10.220 --> 00:02:11.855
There's a visceral hatred

00:02:11.988 --> 00:02:14.090
towards Moscow's leaders among

00:02:14.224 --> 00:02:14.791
these men.

00:02:14.924 --> 00:02:19.362
"In Russia, they have a

00:02:19.696 --> 00:02:22.299
terrorist regime, so now the

00:02:22.432 --> 00:02:24.234
civilized world is fighting

00:02:24.367 --> 00:02:25.902
against this evil dictatorship."

00:02:26.036 --> 00:02:30.440
As we prepare to leave, incoming

00:02:30.573 --> 00:02:32.309
grenades explode.

00:02:32.442 --> 00:02:34.044
They expect much worse in the

00:02:34.177 --> 00:02:36.279
months to come, but their Moto

00:02:36.413 --> 00:02:40.984
is, if not us, who else?

00:02:41.117 --> 00:02:42.252
Wolf, when the Ukrainians talk

00:02:42.385 --> 00:02:43.987
about that, they also say they

00:02:44.120 --> 00:02:48.358
believe especially the moblmonths of

00:02:48.491 --> 00:02:49.859
February and March are going to

00:02:49.993 --> 00:02:50.727
be tough for them.

00:02:50.860 --> 00:02:52.762
Some of the things we are

00:02:52.896 --> 00:02:54.097
seeing, there are several places

00:02:54.230 --> 00:02:55.298
that we have been to where the

00:02:55.732 --> 00:02:57.000
Ukrainians are saying they are

00:02:57.133 --> 00:02:58.368
already seeing the Russians beef

00:02:58.501 --> 00:03:00.136
up forces, especially with those

00:03:00.270 --> 00:03:01.738
people that they mobilized

00:03:01.738 --> 00:03:02.839
towards the end of last year.

00:03:02.972 --> 00:03:04.307
So they do expect that there is

00:03:04.441 --> 00:03:06.142
going to be a large-scale

00:03:06.276 --> 00:03:06.876
offensive coming from the

00:03:07.010 --> 00:03:07.377
Russians.

00:03:07.377 --> 00:03:09.412
As you heard there from the

00:03:09.746 --> 00:03:10.413
paratroopers, they believe they

00:03:10.547 --> 00:03:11.748
can stand their ground.

00:03:11.815 --> 00:03:12.916
However, they say they are going

00:03:13.049 --> 00:03:15.285
to need western weapons, weapons

00:03:15.418 --> 00:03:16.720
from the U.S. And allies to make

00:03:16.853 --> 00:03:17.754
that happen.

00:03:17.754 --> 00:03:19.222
Wolf?
&gt;&gt; Fred, thank you very much.

00:03:19.356 --> 00:03:20.190
Fred pleitgen in the war zone

00:03:20.323 --> 00:03:21.358
for us.

00:03:21.758 --> 00:03:23.426
Stay safe over there, Fred.

00:03:23.760 --> 00:03:24.260
Appreciate it very much.

00:03:24.794 --> 00:03:26.496
I want to dig deeper.

00:03:26.629 --> 00:03:28.498
Joining us retired colonel

00:03:28.631 --> 00:03:34.838
Cedric Layton, a CNN military

00:03:34.971 --> 00:03:35.438
analyst.

00:03:35.438 --> 00:03:37.340
And the former defense

00:03:37.774 --> 00:03:38.908
secretary.

00:03:39.042 --> 00:03:40.877
Russia is gearing up for what

00:03:41.010 --> 00:03:42.512
they're calling maximum

00:03:42.645 --> 00:03:43.046
escalation.

00:03:43.046 --> 00:03:44.347
What are you watching for as

00:03:44.481 --> 00:03:45.048
Russia clearly ramps up its

00:03:45.181 --> 00:03:48.752
military offensive?

00:03:48.885 --> 00:03:50.920
&gt;&gt; Wolf, the main things that

00:03:51.054 --> 00:03:52.455
I'm watching for are how the

00:03:52.589 --> 00:03:54.124
Russians are disposing of their

00:03:54.257 --> 00:03:55.291
forces, where they're putting

00:03:55.425 --> 00:03:57.193
them, how they're moving them,

00:03:57.327 --> 00:03:59.095
are there new troop

00:03:59.229 --> 00:04:00.930
concentrations in specific

00:04:01.064 --> 00:04:03.233
areas?
So for the most part what we are

00:04:03.366 --> 00:04:04.567
seeing and what the Ukrainians

00:04:04.701 --> 00:04:06.703
are seeing is that moving into

00:04:06.836 --> 00:04:09.038
the eastern areas, the areas

00:04:09.172 --> 00:04:11.808
where Fred was just at, these

00:04:11.808 --> 00:04:13.042
are really indications that the

00:04:13.176 --> 00:04:16.012
Russians are moving their forces

00:04:16.146 --> 00:04:16.679
forward.

00:04:16.813 --> 00:04:17.814
Mainly the conscripts.

00:04:17.914 --> 00:04:19.816
But they're moving some of their

00:04:19.816 --> 00:04:21.818
more experienced units, like the

00:04:21.818 --> 00:04:23.386
airborne units into bakhmut.

00:04:23.820 --> 00:04:26.356
That indicates that they really

00:04:26.489 --> 00:04:27.924
believe that particular city,

00:04:28.057 --> 00:04:29.125
that particular town is one that

00:04:29.259 --> 00:04:29.826
they need to capture at this

00:04:29.959 --> 00:04:31.494
point.

00:04:31.828 --> 00:04:34.030
&gt;&gt; Evalyn, what more does

00:04:34.164 --> 00:04:35.064
Ukraine need right now to

00:04:35.198 --> 00:04:37.367
prepare for this major Russian

00:04:37.500 --> 00:04:39.302
escalation that's coming, as it

00:04:39.436 --> 00:04:41.137
is clearly waiting for these

00:04:41.271 --> 00:04:43.339
western battle tanks to be

00:04:43.473 --> 00:04:44.574
deployed?

00:04:44.707 --> 00:04:46.242
&gt;&gt; Well, wolf, you heard Fred

00:04:46.376 --> 00:04:48.611
talk about the fact that the

00:04:48.745 --> 00:04:51.147
Russians have air power or they

00:04:51.281 --> 00:04:55.118
have air, you know, essentially

00:04:55.251 --> 00:04:56.219
power that they can employ

00:04:56.352 --> 00:04:56.986
through the air.

00:04:57.120 --> 00:04:58.221
And I think this is what is

00:04:58.354 --> 00:04:59.889
missing for the Ukrainians.

00:05:00.023 --> 00:05:01.157
You know going back several

00:05:01.291 --> 00:05:02.392
months, the Ukrainians were

00:05:02.525 --> 00:05:06.529
trying to get the soviet era

00:05:06.663 --> 00:05:07.864
fighter aircraft from the poles

00:05:07.864 --> 00:05:08.531
and other nato allies.

00:05:08.665 --> 00:05:10.667
And that didn't work.

00:05:10.800 --> 00:05:13.870
I am hopeful that now, given

00:05:13.937 --> 00:05:16.005
this new offensive, that we will

00:05:16.139 --> 00:05:18.041
turn around and, you know, the

00:05:18.174 --> 00:05:20.276
U.S. Can say we'll provide F-16s

00:05:20.410 --> 00:05:22.512
if that's the green light

00:05:22.645 --> 00:05:24.047
required, the cover required.

00:05:24.180 --> 00:05:26.749
But we need to provide the

00:05:26.883 --> 00:05:27.884
Ukrainians aircraft so they can

00:05:27.884 --> 00:05:29.352
provide cover for troops on the

00:05:29.486 --> 00:05:29.886
ground.

00:05:29.886 --> 00:05:32.689
&gt;&gt; Let me follow up with colonel

00:05:32.822 --> 00:05:33.356
Layton.

00:05:33.490 --> 00:05:37.894
You served in the air force.

00:05:37.894 --> 00:05:39.028
Why is Ukraine pleading for

00:05:39.162 --> 00:05:40.230
these fighter jets from the U.S.

00:05:40.363 --> 00:05:42.198
And allies, despite U.S.

00:05:42.332 --> 00:05:44.434
Opposition that the jets -- the

00:05:44.567 --> 00:05:48.338
U.S. Arguing the jets would be

00:05:48.471 --> 00:05:48.905
"Impractical."

00:05:48.905 --> 00:05:50.874
&gt;&gt; Yeah, so the Ukrainians

00:05:51.007 --> 00:05:52.141
believe that they can use these

00:05:52.275 --> 00:05:54.310
jets with a minimum amount of

00:05:54.444 --> 00:05:54.944
training, wolf.

00:05:54.944 --> 00:05:56.279
I think the fact of the matter,

00:05:56.412 --> 00:05:58.081
is when you look at how pilots

00:05:58.214 --> 00:06:00.950
are trained, it can take up to a

00:06:01.084 --> 00:06:03.920
year to train pilots in certain

00:06:03.920 --> 00:06:05.922
airplanes.
In the case of the Ukrainians, I

00:06:05.922 --> 00:06:07.924
think we're looking at somewhere

00:06:07.957 --> 00:06:10.226
between 3 to 8 months of

00:06:10.360 --> 00:06:12.395
training, so that requires

00:06:12.529 --> 00:06:12.929
something.

00:06:12.929 --> 00:06:15.365
There is also the logistical

00:06:15.498 --> 00:06:17.934
tail to be considered, and the

00:06:17.934 --> 00:06:18.902
right tactics have to be

00:06:19.035 --> 00:06:21.938
developed and used by the newly

00:06:21.938 --> 00:06:24.073
minted f-16 pilots.

00:06:24.207 --> 00:06:25.942
So the U.S. Is reluctant to do

00:06:25.942 --> 00:06:27.510
this because of a lot of these

00:06:27.944 --> 00:06:29.412
considerations.
But if the Ukrainians can prove

00:06:29.546 --> 00:06:31.948
to the U.S. That they can use

00:06:32.081 --> 00:06:33.950
these aircraft and use them

00:06:34.083 --> 00:06:35.518
effectively, then perhaps the

00:06:35.952 --> 00:06:37.954
green light will happen in spite

00:06:37.954 --> 00:06:39.956
of objections we hear right now.

00:06:39.956 --> 00:06:43.293
&gt;&gt; Evalyn, the Israeli prime

00:06:43.426 --> 00:06:44.761
minister Benjamin Netanyahu told

00:06:44.894 --> 00:06:46.496
CNN exclusively last night in an

00:06:46.629 --> 00:06:47.964
interview with Jake tapper that

00:06:47.997 --> 00:06:48.631
he would be willing to mediate

00:06:48.765 --> 00:06:50.567
between Russia and Ukraine.

00:06:50.700 --> 00:06:53.570
Listen to this, listen to this

00:06:53.970 --> 00:06:55.171
exchange.

00:06:55.305 --> 00:06:57.407
&gt;&gt; If I'm asked by both sides,

00:06:57.540 --> 00:06:59.576
and frankly, if I'm asked by the

00:06:59.976 --> 00:07:00.476
United States.

00:07:00.510 --> 00:07:02.812
You can't have too many cooks in

00:07:02.946 --> 00:07:05.248
the kitchen.

00:07:05.381 --> 00:07:07.984
If asked by all relevant

00:07:07.984 --> 00:07:08.585
parties, I would certainly

00:07:08.718 --> 00:07:09.218
consider it.

00:07:09.352 --> 00:07:11.988
But I'm not pushing myself in.

00:07:12.088 --> 00:07:14.457
I think this is of monumental

00:07:14.591 --> 00:07:15.592
peace, because I think the peace

00:07:15.992 --> 00:07:18.061
of the world is at stake.

00:07:18.194 --> 00:07:22.465
&gt;&gt; What is your reaction,

00:07:22.599 --> 00:07:22.966
Evalyn?

00:07:22.966 --> 00:07:24.400
&gt;&gt; Everyone wants to be a

00:07:24.534 --> 00:07:26.336
mediator, but the situation

00:07:26.469 --> 00:07:28.004
isn't right for mediation.

00:07:28.004 --> 00:07:28.871
Vladamir Putin is hardly ready

00:07:29.005 --> 00:07:30.740
to back down, as you hear the

00:07:30.873 --> 00:07:31.507
Ukrainians saying.

00:07:31.641 --> 00:07:33.109
In fact, the Russians

00:07:33.242 --> 00:07:33.643
themselves.

00:07:33.643 --> 00:07:35.044
They're ready to launch another

00:07:35.178 --> 00:07:35.511
assault.

00:07:35.511 --> 00:07:38.014
They are not giving up.

00:07:38.014 --> 00:07:39.048
And obviously, same thing for

00:07:39.182 --> 00:07:40.016
the Ukrainians.

00:07:40.016 --> 00:07:41.284
They're not giving up any square

00:07:41.417 --> 00:07:44.020
footage of their land.

00:07:44.087 --> 00:07:48.024
So that's not a situation that's

00:07:48.024 --> 00:07:48.691
ripe for negotiation.

00:07:48.825 --> 00:07:51.194
One side needs to be winning or

00:07:51.327 --> 00:07:52.662
both sides need to feel like

00:07:52.795 --> 00:07:54.030
they're losing.

00:07:54.097 --> 00:07:54.931
So what prime minister Netanyahu

00:07:55.064 --> 00:07:58.935
is offering is fine, but

00:07:59.068 --> 00:08:00.236
frankly, what Israel needs to

00:08:00.370 --> 00:08:02.271
offer is weaponry to the

00:08:02.405 --> 00:08:03.106
Ukrainians so they can defeat

00:08:03.239 --> 00:08:07.076
the Russians and defeat this vie

00:08:07.210 --> 00:08:09.045
relate, aggressive international

